    "t104": "Getting started",
    "t105": "Get started in three steps",
    "t106": "Fjelia is in public beta. Try it in your daily routine and help improve future releases.",
    "t107": "Install TestFlight",
    "t108": "Get Apple's free <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/testflight/id899247664\">TestFlight app</a> on your iPhone. It lets you install and update beta apps.",
    "t109": "Join the Fjelia beta",
    "t110": "<a href=\"https://testflight.apple.com/join/CqzrybFA\">Open the beta invitation</a> on your iPhone, accept it and install Fjelia through TestFlight.",
    "t111": "Connect your data",
    "t112": "Complete setup and choose Apple Health or a supported service. Allow the first sync time to bring in your history.",
    "t113": "Still in development. Your feedback helps us improve Fjelia.",
    "t114": "Good to know",
    "t115": "Before you start",
    "t116": "Answers to common questions about Fjelia.",
    "t117": "Is Fjelia free?",
    "t118": "The public beta and Free AI are free. Using your own API key with another cloud provider may incur charges from that provider.",
    "t119": "Which iPhone do I need?",
    "t120": "Check the TestFlight invitation for current iPhone requirements. Free AI works without Apple Intelligence. For local Apple AI, you need a compatible device with iOS 26+, Apple Intelligence enabled and a supported language.",
    "t121": "Do I need a particular watch?",
    "t122": "No. You can connect Apple Health or supported services including Garmin, Polar, Suunto and COROS. Available metrics depend on what each device measures and each service shares. Some connections may be unavailable in a particular beta build.",
    "t123": "Can I use Fjelia without Apple Intelligence?",
    "t124": "Yes. Free AI provides online coaching without your own API key. You can also use Fjelia without AI. Explore the <a href=\"#ai\">AI options</a>.",
    "t125": "Where does my data go?",
    "t126": "Your database stays on your device. Connected services exchange data directly with your phone. Optional cloud coaching sends the context you approve to your selected provider. Weather and maps contact their providers when used. <a href=\"privacy.html\">Read the full privacy policy.</a>",
    "t127": "How do I delete my data?",
    "t128": "Deleting Fjelia removes its local database. You can revoke service access and Apple Health permissions separately. Delete any backups or exports you created from wherever you saved them. Data held by connected services must be managed with those services.",
    "t129": "Is this a medical app?",
    "t130": "Fjelia is for fitness and general wellness. It is not a medical device and does not diagnose or treat conditions. Discuss health concerns with a qualified healthcare professional.",
    "t131": "Report a problem or share an idea",
    "t132": "Help improve Fjelia",
