    "t139": "Send feedback <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span>",
    "t140": "You can also <a href=\"https://github.com/agilastic/fjelia/issues\">suggest a feature or report a bug on GitHub</a>. Please leave out private information.",
    "t141": "Free and open-source software",
    "t142": "Fjelia is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later. Explore the code, build the app and help improve it.",
    "t143": "<a class=\"btn primary\" href=\"https://testflight.apple.com/join/CqzrybFA\">Join the iOS beta</a> <a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"https://github.com/agilastic/fjelia\">Source code on GitHub</a>",
    "t144": "Fjelia is available as a public beta through TestFlight. It is not on the App Store yet. Development is ongoing, so you may encounter bugs. Some services need app credentials when building from source. See the README for details.",
    "t145": "Requires Flutter and Xcode. Apple Intelligence needs a supported device with iOS or macOS 26 or later.",
    "t146": "Please note",
    "t147": "<strong>Not a medical device.</strong> Recovery, readiness, blood-pressure and training values are informational and do not replace advice from a doctor. Some integrations are unofficial. Provider updates may affect syncing or availability.",
